# Ford's "for your safety" popup on a press of the front camera button (HMI_AL, SYNC 3.4.22251,
# RVC_PAC_Send_Signal_handler at 0x2fd8bc): shown above 10 km/h, 20 in an off-road state. With "Extended Speed Range" on
# it is shown above 31 km/h instead, where the camera has nothing to show (the module's own limit). The two
# "vmov.f64 d7, #limit" instructions; written by rvcpatch -name HMI_AL -places <this file>, in memory only, checked byte
# for byte first. The installer copies the file for the SYNC build it finds to popup.places.
#   address  now               ours
2fd9d4 047bb3ee94229fe5 0f7bb3ee94229fe5
2fdba0 047bb2eec8309fe5 0f7bb3eec8309fe5
